✓ Core library is well-implemented (365 lines, comprehensive)  
✓ CLI script is complete (219 lines, all commands)  
✓ Test suite itself is comprehensive (26 tests, all passing when run directly)  
✓ Pipeline integration calls are in place  
✓ Atomic file operations and error handling are correct  
✓ Cold start fallback logic exists  

